        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 84080EDGRKN, Over the Edge Select Cabinet Round Knurled Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Select Cabinet Edge Pull installs over the edge of the cabinet and screws into the backside of the drawer. The Select Cabinet Round Knurled Edge Pull has a textured grip that is very hot in the design world right now. This Knurled Pull is available in 7 sizes including 5-1/4 inches, 8-1/4 inches, and 12-1/4 inches. Choose your favorite modern finish color.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Knurled Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-84080-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262438\"><b>Emtek 84080 Select Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 8 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-84080:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84081:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84082:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84083:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>EMT-84084:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84085:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84086:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84087:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 18-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
